  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A solid cylinder of mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi></math> is wrapped with an inextensible light string and, is placed on a rough inclined plane as shown in the figure. The frictional force acting between the cylinder and the inclined plane is:</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/1eb49289-6088-4647-819f-c024424e0a19-image.png\" style=\"width: 155px; height: 243px;\" /></p><p>[The coefficient of static friction, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#956;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></msub></math>,&nbsp;is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn></math>&nbsp;]</p>",
    "image": null
  },
